# Shadows of the Departed (jeuno 88): the finishes when their state no longer holds. A level 75 Warrior, Storms of Fate
# completed, Zilart Awakening current, brought to status 3. 161 open, Storms of Fate set available by a GM: the finish
# finds no state: no Note, not begun. Then accepted with the three slivers (a GM): 162 open, the quest set available by a
# GM: the finish finds the available state only (no 162 finish there): nothing (the slivers kept, no Timer or mustZone
# for Apocalypse Nigh).
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/161 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/162
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=4,2.5,100 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate completed
mission Zilart Awakening current
login
warp 120.9,-8,-12 Norg                  # 176: status 1
warp 39.6,-1.6,-16.6 LowerJeuno         # by _6tc
trigger _6tc                            # 20
finish                                  # status 3
warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
tick 3000                               # the zone-in lock (2.5 s) keeps trigger areas off
walk 4,2.5,60                           # 161
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate available      # a GM, while 161 is open
finish                                  # no state: no Note, not begun
walk 4,2.5,100
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate completed      # a GM
quest Jeuno.ShadowsOfTheDeparted accepted  # a GM
keyitem PromyvionHollaSliver            # a GM: the three slivers
keyitem PromyvionDemSliver
keyitem PromyvionMeaSliver
walk 4,2.5,60                           # 162
quest Jeuno.ShadowsOfTheDeparted available  # a GM, while 162 is open
finish                                  # the available state has no 162 finish: nothing
